{
  "title": "Travel agent: cost by backend",
  "uid": "travel-agent-costs",
  "tags": [
    "travel-agent",
    "cost"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "datasource",
        "name": "ds",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "custom",
        "name": "ns",
        "label": "Environment",
        "query": "travel-agent,travel-agent-dev",
        "current": {
          "text": "travel-agent",
          "value": "travel-agent"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "travel-agent",
            "value": "travel-agent",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "travel-agent-dev",
            "value": "travel-agent-dev",
            "selected": false
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Cost per chat backend in **tokens and Tavily credits** (no USD). Pick the environment with **ns**.\n\n- **LLM tokens** come from the project Alloy's token rule over each backend's `gen_ai` spans; *input* includes cache reads and writes. Totals are approximate: Prometheus' `increase()` extrapolates at the range edges, and a brand-new series loses its first data point.\n- **Tavily credits** are what Tavily reports per search: a **lower bound** (timed-out calls may still be billed). Cross-check in Tavily's dashboard, filtered by project `travel-agent-<backend>`.\n- Search **limits are shared** across backends, so a `limited` outcome during a comparison is a stack limit, not a framework failure.\n- Traces: [Tempo, this namespace](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22queryType%22:%22traceql%22,%22query%22:%22%7Bresource.service.namespace%3D%5C%22$ns%5C%22%7D%22%7D%5D%7D).\n\nHow each backend is measured: `docs/agent-frameworks.md`, \"Cost\"."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Cost by backend (selected range)",
      "description": "One row per backend, zeros included. Tokens approximate; credits a lower bound.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "(sum by (backend) (label_replace(increase(travel_agent_llm_tokens{job=~\"$ns/.*\", gen_ai_token_type=\"input\"}[$__range]), \"backend\", \"$1\", \"job\", \".*/travel-agent-(.+)\"))) or on (backend) (label_replace(vector(0), \"backend\", \"inkeep\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(vector(0), \"backend\", \"parlant\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(vector(0), \"backend\", \"langgraph\", \"\", \"\"))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "(sum by (backend) (label_replace(increase(travel_agent_llm_tokens{job=~\"$ns/.*\", gen_ai_token_type=\"output\"}[$__range]), \"backend\", \"$1\", \"job\", \".*/travel-agent-(.+)\"))) or on (backend) (label_replace(vector(0), \"backend\", \"inkeep\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(vector(0), \"backend\", \"parlant\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(vector(0), \"backend\", \"langgraph\", \"\", \"\"))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "(sum by (backend) (label_replace(increase(travel_agent_search_credits_total{job=\"$ns/travel-agent-api\", client!=\"unknown\"}[$__range]), \"backend\", \"$1\", \"client\", \"(.+)\"))) or on (backend) (label_replace(vector(0), \"backend\", \"inkeep\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(vector(0), \"backend\", \"parlant\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(vector(0), \"backend\", \"langgraph\", \"\", \"\"))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "(sum by (backend) (label_replace(increase(travel_agent_search_requests_total{job=\"$ns/travel-agent-api\", client!=\"unknown\", outcome=~\"ok|cached\"}[$__range]), \"backend\", \"$1\", \"client\", \"(.+)\"))) or on (backend) (label_replace(vector(0), \"backend\", \"inkeep\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(vector(0), \"backend\", \"parlant\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(vector(0), \"backend\", \"langgraph\", \"\", \"\"))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #A": "Input tokens",
              "Value #B": "Output tokens",
              "Value #C": "Tavily credits",
              "Value #D": "Searches",
              "backend": "Backend"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Backend"
          }
        ]
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Tokens by backend and type (selected range)",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (backend, gen_ai_token_type) (label_replace(increase(travel_agent_llm_tokens{job=~\"$ns/.*\"}[$__range]), \"backend\", \"$1\", \"job\", \".*/travel-agent-(.+)\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{backend}} {{gen_ai_token_type}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "groupingToMatrix",
          "options": {
            "columnField": "gen_ai_token_type",
            "rowField": "backend",
            "valueField": "Value"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "stacking": "normal",
        "xField": "backend\\gen_ai_token_type",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens over time by backend and model",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (backend, gen_ai_response_model) (label_replace(increase(travel_agent_llm_tokens{job=~\"$ns/.*\"}[$__rate_interval]), \"backend\", \"$1\", \"job\", \".*/travel-agent-(.+)\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{backend}} \u00b7 {{gen_ai_response_model}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tavily credits over time by backend (lower bound)",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (backend) (label_replace(increase(travel_agent_search_credits_total{job=\"$ns/travel-agent-api\", client!=\"unknown\"}[$__rate_interval]), \"backend\", \"$1\", \"client\", \"(.+)\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{backend}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Searches by backend and outcome (selected range)",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (backend, outcome) (label_replace(increase(travel_agent_search_requests_total{job=\"$ns/travel-agent-api\", client!=\"unknown\"}[$__range]), \"backend\", \"$1\", \"client\", \"(.+)\"))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "groupingToMatrix",
          "options": {
            "columnField": "outcome",
            "rowField": "backend",
            "valueField": "Value"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "stacking": "normal",
        "xField": "backend\\outcome",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Search cache hit ratio by backend",
      "description": "Cached \u00f7 (ok + cached). The cache is per backend.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (backend) (label_replace(increase(travel_agent_search_requests_total{job=\"$ns/travel-agent-api\", client!=\"unknown\", outcome=\"cached\"}[$__range]), \"backend\", \"$1\", \"client\", \"(.+)\")) / sum by (backend) (label_replace(increase(travel_agent_search_requests_total{job=\"$ns/travel-agent-api\", client!=\"unknown\", outcome=~\"ok|cached\"}[$__range]), \"backend\", \"$1\", \"client\", \"(.+)\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{backend}}",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "no searches"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      }
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  }
}
